Kind: widen
Issue: #765
Holds open: the race the run's end had with char_test. char_test waits 8 seconds after its start line before its first arm, so ipc_bench has started by then -- its start line is the run's terminator -- and the run ends one second later unless the loop waits for char_test's count. The fixed tree waits for it (expected_reports lists the pair) and passes; the ablation that takes the pair out of that list is cut with char_test between its arms.
Accel: tcg
